    "reviews": "\u201cTitanic: Adventure Out of Time is a showstopper -- dazzling, extraordinary edutainment at its very best.\u201d<br />\r\n100 \u2013 World Village<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI found Titanic to be a thoroughly enjoyable and and thought-provoking game.\u201d<br />\r\n93 \u2013 Gamezilla<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cTitanic is a worthy successor of Dust and one of the better adventure games of 1996.\u201d<br />\r\n91 \u2013 Mac Gamer<br />\r\n",
